## Supabase Edge Functions deployed
1. `generate-monthly-records` — auto-generates rent income + recurring expenses on 1st of month
   - JWT verification: OFF
   - Cron: `0 6 1 * *`
2. `ai-chat` — secure proxy to Anthropic API for AI Portfolio Advisor
   - JWT verification: OFF
   - Secret: ANTHROPIC_KEY stored in Supabase secrets
   - Model: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
3. `create-checkout-session` — creates Stripe checkout session
   - JWT verification: OFF
   - Secrets: STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_PRICE_ID
   - success_url hardcoded to https://proflet.com/success
   - cancel_url hardcoded to https://proflet.com/paywall
4. `stripe-webhook` — handles Stripe webhook events, updates subscriptions table
   - JWT verification: OFF
   - Uses constructEventAsync (not constructEvent)
   - Sends welcome email via Zoho SMTP on checkout.session.completed
   - Secret: STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, ZOHO_EMAIL, ZOHO_PASSWORD

## Supabase secrets stored
- ANTHROPIC_KEY — Anthropic API key for AI chat
- STRIPE_SECRET_KEY — Stripe secret key (sk_live_...)
- STRIPE_PRICE_ID — Stripe price ID (price_live_...)
- STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET — Stripe webhook signing secret (whsec_... live mode)
- ZOHO_EMAIL — hello@proflet.com
- ZOHO_PASSWORD — Zoho Mail password

## Stripe setup
- LIVE mode
- Product: "Proflet yearly subscription" — £19/year
